flowchart LR
    U[Client / Postman] -->|HTTP JSON| R[Gin Router]
    R --> H[HTTP handlers and request DTOs]
    H --> A[JWT authentication / role checks]
    A --> S[Service layer]
    S --> P[Repository layer]
    P --> DB[(PostgreSQL - source of truth)]
    S -. best-effort product reads .-> C[(Redis cache with TTL and versioned invalidation)]
    M[Product create/update/deactivate] -->|increment cache generation| C
    WH[HMAC-signed mock payment callback] --> PH[Payment handler]
    PH --> PS[Payment service]
    PS --> PR[Payment repository]
    PR --> DB
    W[Periodic read-only reconciliation worker] --> PS
    DB --- IM[Inventory movement audit]
